{"title":"Open-source components","description":"The main open-source libraries and programs Stirling PDF is built on.","unlisted":false,"space":"developers","layout":"","article":"<a class=\"doc-space\" data-accent=\"developers\" href=\"/Developers/\"><svg class=\"icon\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m16 18 6-6-6-6M8 6l-6 6 6 6\"/></svg><span>Developers</span></a>\n    <h1>Open-source components</h1>\n<p>Stirling PDF is built on these open-source projects. The full source is on <a href=\"https://github.com/Stirling-Tools/Stirling-PDF\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">GitHub</a>.</p>\n<h2 id=\"server\" class=\"anchor-heading\">Server<a class=\"anchor-link\" href=\"#server\" aria-label=\"Direct link\">#</a></h2><ul>\n<li><strong><a href=\"https://pdfbox.apache.org/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">PDFBox</a></strong> - core PDF reading and editing</li>\n<li><strong>JPDFium</strong> - PDFium-based engine for merge, split and reading text and tables</li>\n<li><strong><a href=\"https://github.com/tabulapdf/tabula-java\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Tabula</a></strong> - table extraction</li>\n<li><strong><a href=\"https://www.libreoffice.org/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">LibreOffice</a></strong> - office document conversion</li>\n<li><strong><a href=\"https://qpdf.sourceforge.io/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">qpdf</a></strong> and <strong><a href=\"https://www.ghostscript.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Ghostscript</a></strong> - PDF optimisation and compression</li>\n<li><strong><a href=\"https://ocrmypdf.readthedocs.io/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">OCRmyPDF</a></strong> with <strong><a href=\"https://github.com/tesseract-ocr/tesseract\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Tesseract</a></strong> - text recognition</li>\n<li><strong><a href=\"https://calibre-ebook.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Calibre</a></strong> - e-book conversion</li>\n<li><strong><a href=\"https://imagemagick.org/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">ImageMagick</a></strong> and <strong><a href=\"https://opencv.org/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">OpenCV</a></strong> - image processing</li>\n<li><strong><a href=\"https://weasyprint.org/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">WeasyPrint</a></strong> - HTML to PDF</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"ai-engine\" class=\"anchor-heading\">AI engine<a class=\"anchor-link\" href=\"#ai-engine\" aria-label=\"Direct link\">#</a></h2><ul>\n<li><strong><a href=\"https://fastapi.tiangolo.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">FastAPI</a></strong> and <strong><a href=\"https://ai.pydantic.dev/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Pydantic AI</a></strong> (Python)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"web-app\" class=\"anchor-heading\">Web app<a class=\"anchor-link\" href=\"#web-app\" aria-label=\"Direct link\">#</a></h2><ul>\n<li><strong><a href=\"https://react.dev/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">React</a></strong> and <strong><a href=\"https://www.typescriptlang.org/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">TypeScript</a></strong>, built with <strong><a href=\"https://vitejs.dev/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Vite</a></strong></li>\n<li><strong><a href=\"https://www.embedpdf.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">EmbedPDF</a></strong> and <strong><a href=\"https://mozilla.github.io/pdf.js/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">PDF.js</a></strong> - viewing and annotation</li>\n<li><strong><a href=\"https://github.com/cantoo-scribe/pdf-lib\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">pdf-lib</a></strong> (Cantoo fork) - PDF editing in the browser</li>\n<li><strong><a href=\"https://mantine.dev/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Mantine</a></strong> - UI components</li>\n<li><strong><a href=\"https://www.i18next.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">i18next</a></strong> - translations for 40+ languages</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"desktop-app\" class=\"anchor-heading\">Desktop app<a class=\"anchor-link\" href=\"#desktop-app\" aria-label=\"Direct link\">#</a></h2><ul>\n<li><strong><a href=\"https://tauri.app/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Tauri</a></strong> - native app for Windows, macOS and Linux</li>\n</ul>\n\n    <div class=\"doc-source\">\n      <a href=\"https://github.com/Stirling-Tools/Stirling-Tools.github.io/edit/main/docs/Developers/Technologies.md\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">\n        <svg width=\"14\" height=\"14\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\"><path d=\"M17 3a2.83 2.83 0 1 1 4 4L7.5 20.5 2 22l1.5-5.5L17 3z\"/></svg>\n        Edit this page on GitHub\n      </a>\n    </div>","toc":"<div class=\"toc-title\">On this page</div><ul><li class=\"toc-l2\"><a href=\"#server\">Server</a></li>\n<li class=\"toc-l2\"><a href=\"#ai-engine\">AI engine</a></li>\n<li class=\"toc-l2\"><a href=\"#web-app\">Web app</a></li>\n<li class=\"toc-l2\"><a href=\"#desktop-app\">Desktop app</a></li></ul>","pager":"<a class=\"pager-link pager-prev\" href=\"/Developers/Contributing/\">\n        <span class=\"pager-dir\">&larr; Previous</span>\n        <span class=\"pager-title\">Contributing</span>\n      </a><span></span>"}